==Latin==
{{cardinalbox|la|LXIX|LXX|LXXI|undeseptuaginta|alt=septuāgintā|ord=septuagesimus|ordalt=septuāgēsimus|headlink=Appendix:Latin cardinal numerals}}
===Etymology===
From earlier {{term||septmāginta}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|septm̥̄ḱomt|lang=la}}, from earlier *{{term|sc=unicode||septḿ̥-dḱomt|seven-ten}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|sc=polytonic|ἑβδομήκοντα|tr=hebdomēkonta|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/sepˌtu.aːˈgin.taː/|lang=la}}

===Numeral===
{{la-num-card|septuāgintā}}

# {{cardinal|lang=la}} [[seventy]]; 70

